#: ../../reference/types.rst:91 2b4da4d1c50b4c66a93b68c2f5b4651e
msgid ""
"``JsonScalar`` is ``str | int | float | bool | None``. ``JsonValue`` "
"recursively adds JSON arrays and objects, and ``JsonObject`` is "
"``dict[str, JsonValue]``. These aliases describe untyped protocol "
"fragments and extension payloads."
msgstr ""
"``JsonScalar`` 是 ``str | int | float | bool | None``。``JsonValue`` 递归地添加 JSON 数组和对象，"
"而 ``JsonObject`` 是 ``dict[str, JsonValue]``。这些别名描述未类型化的协议片段和扩展负载。"

